311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (The scope includes a small web application or sample service, source control, automated validation, container image creation, registry publication, Kubernetes deployment, service exposure, monitoring, and operational documentation. Jenkins is used as a representative CI/CD tool, Docker for packaging, Amazon ECR for image storage, Amazon EKS for managed Kubernetes, and Prometheus with Grafana for observability. Equivalent tools can be substituted when required by the institution or available infrastructure.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
312 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (The project is an academic reference design rather than a claim that a production environment has already been deployed. Production readiness would require detailed capacity planning, security review, compliance assessment, backup strategy, disaster recovery, service-level objectives, and budget approval. A local cluster can be used to validate manifests before creating cloud resources.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
