/E (The project follows an iterative engineering methodology. First, the deployment problem and stakeholder needs are identified. Second, functional and non-functional requirements are documented. Third, the architecture is divided into source control, pipeline, container registry, orchestration, cloud networking, and monitoring components. Each component is tested independently and then integrated into an end-to-end workflow.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
