/T (DevOps emphasises shared ownership, small and frequent changes, automation, measurable outcomes, and continuous feedback. It does not consist of a single product. Teams use automation to make repeatable actions consistent, and they use monitoring and incident reviews to improve future changes. Collaboration between developers and operators helps make applications easier to deploy and maintain.)
/E (DevOps emphasises shared ownership, small and frequent changes, automation, measurable outcomes, and continuous feedback. It does not consist of a single product. Teams use automation to make repeatable actions consistent, and they use monitoring and incident reviews to improve future changes. Collaboration between developers and operators helps make applications easier to deploy and maintain.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
