/P 164 0 R
/T (Continuous Delivery keeps software in a releasable state after automated checks have passed. A release may require an authorised approval before production. Continuous Deployment automatically releases changes that pass all required controls. The appropriate choice depends on the application's risk, organisational policy, and testing maturity.)
/E (Continuous Delivery keeps software in a releasable state after automated checks have passed. A release may require an authorised approval before production. Continuous Deployment automatically releases changes that pass all required controls. The appropriate choice depends on the application's risk, organisational policy, and testing maturity.)
