357 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (In a manual workflow, an operator may download or pull source code, install dependencies, build the application, copy files to a server, restart the service, and verify the result. This approach can be understandable for a small project, but it becomes error-prone when the steps are repeated across environments. Different operators may use different commands, and the exact version deployed may not be clearly recorded.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
358 0 obj
<<
