/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
359 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (Modern deployment practices use pipeline-as-code, automated tests, immutable artifacts, declarative infrastructure, and deployment health checks. The pipeline becomes a repeatable record of how a release was produced. Declarative manifests describe the desired workload state, and the orchestrator works to converge the running environment toward that state.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 165 0 R
/T (2.3 Git and Version Control)
