/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
361 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (Git records changes as commits and supports branching, review, and recovery to earlier revisions. A commit identifier can be associated with an image tag, helping an operator connect a running release to its source revision. Protected branches, code review, and required checks reduce the risk of unreviewed changes entering a release branch.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
