/E (An AWS deployment commonly uses a VPC with public and private subnets. Worker nodes and application Pods may be placed in private subnets, while a public load balancer exposes only the intended application endpoint. Security groups and network policies should permit only required communication. Administrative access should use approved secure channels and should not expose cluster management endpoints unnecessarily.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
