/P 173 0 R
/E (Source code and configuration should be recoverable through version control. Container images should follow a retention policy. Stateful application data requires a separate backup and restore strategy because rolling back a container does not reverse database changes or restore deleted data. Recovery procedures should be tested and documented.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [12]
>>
