/E (A Kubernetes Deployment describes the desired replica count, container image, labels, ports, and update strategy. The selector must match the labels on the Pod template. The container port should match the application listener. Readiness probes prevent traffic from reaching a Pod before it is ready. Resource requests help the scheduler place workloads, while limits constrain consumption.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
