/P 180 0 R
/E (A Service selects Pods using labels and provides a stable network endpoint. A ClusterIP Service exposes the application inside the cluster. For external access, an approved Ingress controller or load balancer can be configured. The chosen method should match the network design and should expose only the necessary port.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
