591 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (During a rolling update, Kubernetes gradually replaces old Pods with new ones. Readiness probes and appropriate rollout settings reduce the risk of sending traffic to an unready version. Monitor error rate, latency, and Pod status while the update proceeds. A rollout should be stopped or rolled back if the new version causes significant impact.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
