/E (Prometheus scrapes metrics from configured endpoints at regular intervals and stores them as time series. Application metrics require an instrumented endpoint or exporter. Kubernetes and node metrics may require additional exporters and permissions. Metrics endpoints should be restricted where necessary, and collection intervals should balance useful resolution against system overhead.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
