/E (A useful Grafana dashboard identifies the application and environment, uses clear units, and shows meaningful time ranges. Panels may include request throughput, error percentage, latency percentiles, CPU, memory, replica count, and restart count. Access should use role- based permissions. Operational dashboards should not be exposed publicly without a deliberate security review.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [6]
>>
