<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 186 0 R
/E (This project presents a DevOps-oriented design for automating application delivery with CI/CD, Docker, Kubernetes, and AWS. The workflow connects source control, automated validation, versioned artifacts, registry publishing, declarative deployment, rollout verification, and monitoring. This structure can improve consistency and make failures easier to investigate. The effectiveness of the system depends on meaningful tests, secure permissions, clear ownership, and operational feedback.)
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [13]
>>
