/Title (The system can be considered demonstrable when a valid change completes the pipeline, a failed test blocks release, an image is traceable to its source revision, Kubernetes reaches a healthy rollout, and monitoring data is visible. Recovery should be demonstrated or documented. Any result table must distinguish tests actually executed from tests that are only planned.)
/Dest [38 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1767 0 R
