/Title (A demonstration that only builds an image and deploys it does not fully address operational reliability. A complete learning project should also include failure handling, traceability, readiness checks, monitoring, least-privilege access, cost awareness, and rollback planning. This project combines these topics in a single workflow so that delivery automation and operational feedback are considered together.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1850 0 R
