/Title (If tests fail, the pipeline stops before image publication. If registry authentication fails, deployment must not proceed. If Kubernetes cannot pull the image or Pods fail readiness checks, rollout verification reports the problem. The previous healthy version may remain available depending on the deployment strategy. Operators investigate logs and events, correct the issue, or roll back.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1883 0 R
>>
