1898 0 obj
<<
/Title (Pull requests should run validation and tests without automatically changing production. A merge to the main branch may build and publish a candidate image. Deployment to a test environment can be automatic, while production can require authorised approval. The same immutable image should be promoted between environments rather than rebuilding different artifacts for each stage.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1891 0 R
>>
endobj
1899 0 obj
<<
/Title (The commit identifier should be included in image metadata or its tag. The pipeline should record the repository revision, build result, image reference, and deployment target. When an incident occurs, this information helps determine which source revision is running and which pipeline created it. Immutable tags or image digests reduce ambiguity caused by mutable labels.)
/Dest [26 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1892 0 R
>>
endobj
